Package: gvauchi
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: qvauchi
Replaces: vauchi-gtk
Breaks: vauchi-gtk
Provides: vauchi-gtk
Description: Privacy-focused updatable contact cards (GTK desktop)
 Vauchi lets you exchange updatable contact cards in person.
 End-to-end encrypted and decentralized. This package provides
 gvauchi, the native Linux desktop client built with GTK4 and
 libadwaita. It replaces the vauchi-gtk package.

Package: qvauchi
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: gvauchi
Replaces: vauchi-qt
Breaks: vauchi-qt
Provides: vauchi-qt
Description: Privacy-focused updatable contact cards (Qt desktop)
 Vauchi lets you exchange updatable contact cards in person.
 End-to-end encrypted and decentralized. This package provides
 qvauchi, the native Linux desktop client built with Qt 6. It replaces
 the vauchi-qt package. Install gvauchi or qvauchi, not both: they share
 one data directory.
